msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-style-guide.rst:353
#: a474aa87ea9a4b4aabbfcd058659041b
msgid "Images are stored on Github, so we need to keep the overall size low. Crop images to the relevant information and reduce image quality where possible."
msgstr ""

